Open Source Architecture:
Sofuu and its companion on-device cognitive vector memory engine (QTSQ) are
100% open source:
- Sofuu Runtime: https://github.com/sofuu-runtime/sofuu (MIT)
- QTSQ Engine:   https://github.com/haruhito2666/qtsq (Apache License 2.0)

Third-party components:
Sofuu links or bundles QuickJS, libuv, http-parser, libcurl, libopus and
supporting Rust crates, each under its own permissive licence. Their copyright
notices and licence texts are reproduced in `NOTICE`. `NOTICE` travels inside
every release archive next to the binary and must not be removed.
